    {
      "page": 22,
      "text": "Mechanical inspection during commissioning phase\n✓\n✓\n✓\n✓\n✓",
      "char_count": 58
    },
    {
      "page": 23,
      "text": "Unpacking and installation\n•",
      "char_count": 28
    },
    {
      "page": 24,
      "text": "Battery breakers. \nSeparate for each \nstring.\n•\nAfter the cables are \ninstalled, keep all feed \nbreakers open, including \nthe input breaker, bypass \nbreaker, and neutral and \nbattery breakers.\nUnpacking and installation",
      "char_count": 219
    },
    {
      "page": 25,
      "text": "Unpacking and installation\n•\nIf the unit contains internal \nbatteries, use a known-good DMM \nto make sure that power is not \npresent in the cable terminals. \n•\nThere is a separate battery \nbreaker for each string in the \ninternal battery cabinet.",
      "char_count": 246
    },
    {
      "page": 26,
      "text": "External batteries\n•",
      "char_count": 20
    },
    {
      "page": 27,
      "text": "•\nRemove the side cover\nUnpacking and installation",
      "char_count": 50
    },
    {
      "page": 28,
      "text": "Unpacking and installation\nMeasure and ensure there is no short circuit in the input connection \nterminals. \nKeep the input breaker open.\nMeasure and ensure there is no short circuit in the output connection \nterminal.",
      "char_count": 218
    },
    {
      "page": 29,
      "text": "",
      "char_count": 0
    },
    {
      "page": 30,
      "text": "Make sure that the UPS input \nand bypass breakers (in case \nof dual input) are open.\nClose the feed breaker(s) to \napply utility and bypass power \nto the unit. (external breakers \nfrom facility)\nMeasure the voltage at input \nconnection terminals:\nMeasure the voltages phase-\nto-phase, phase-to-neutral, and \nphase-to-ground.\nMake sure that the voltages \nare within the acceptable limits.\nMake sure that there is less \nthan 5 VAC from neutral-to-\nground.\nUse a phase rotation meter (or \nsimilar) to make sure that the \nphase rotation is correct.\nClose the UPS input and \nbypass switches. Close all \nbattery breakers.",
      "char_count": 615
    },
    {
      "page": 31,
      "text": "•\nRe-install the side cover",
      "char_count": 27
    },
    {
      "page": 32,
      "text": "•\n•\n•\n•",
      "char_count": 7
    },
    {
      "page": 33,
      "text": "•\n•",
      "char_count": 3
    },
    {
      "page": 34,
      "text": "•\n•\n•\n→\n087 Battery Switchgear Open\n061 Configuration Error 16512\nActive events – Log screen",
      "char_count": 92
    },
    {
      "page": 35,
      "text": "Active events – configuration error\nError code 16512. \n• Battery cells per string \nneed to be configured.\no See the next slide\n• Setup required. Needs to \nbe cleared. \no See the next slide\n087 Battery Switchgear Open\n061 Configuration Error 16512",
      "char_count": 246
    },
    {
      "page": 36,
      "text": "Display\n•\n•\n•",
